  "title": "Vegan Lentil Sloppy Joes",
  "description": "Ditch the ground beef and use green lentils instead for these Sloppy Joe sandwiches that are perfect for vegetarian and vegan dinner guests.",
  "authors": [
    "Laura Shansey"
  ],
